  "id": 8859760230599,
  "title": "Personalized Floral Cross Personalized Text Blanket, Lightweight",
  "handle": "personalized-floral-cross-personalized-text-blanket-lightweight",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with this personalized Christian throw blanket from Jeminise. Designed to inspire and uplift, this unique blanket makes a heartfelt keepsake or a meaningful gift for Christian women, featuring faith-based messages and custom personalization options.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Christian Women:</strong> A perfect personalized gift combining faith, love, and comfort, ideal as a keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Customization:</strong> Personalize your blanket with a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind, meaningful item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for the perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features uplifting Christian themes and faith-based messages for daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect for Any Occasion:</strong> An ideal thoughtful gift for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Lightweight:</strong> Made with polyester fabric for a lightweight and comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Hand wash only for simple maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
